{"items": [{"text": "T", "x": 55.96979904174805, "y": 75.32682800292969, "width": 33.364017486572266, "height": 66.55693054199219, "font_size": 57.032501220703125, "font_name": "LaskiSans-Bold"}, {"text": "he Cosmere Roleplaying Game is a ", "x": 92.18499755859375, "y": 94.6821060180664, "width": 163.33163452148438, "height": 11.029502868652344, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "tabletop roleplaying game (RPG) in which \n", "x": 92.18499755859375, "y": 107.6780776977539, "width": 186.30450439453125, "height": 11.029502868652344, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "you and a group of friends collaboratively tell \n", "x": 92.18501281738281, "y": 120.6740493774414, "width": 197.7424774169922, "height": 11.029502868652344, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "a story of heroes in a\u00a0universe of adventure and ", "x": 56.99700927734375, "y": 133.67002868652344, "width": 203.5072021484375, "height": 11.029495239257812, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "powerful Investiture. This handbook provides rules ", "x": 56.99700927734375, "y": 146.66600036621094, "width": 222.41876220703125, "height": 11.029495239257812, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "for playing in the world of Roshar\u2014the\u00a0setting for ", "x": 56.99700927734375, "y": 159.66197204589844, "width": 215.995849609375, "height": 11.029495239257812, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "the Stormlight Archive novels. In this game, you and ", "x": 56.99700927734375, "y": 172.65794372558594, "width": 227.96017456054688, "height": 11.029495239257812, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "your fellow players take on the roles of characters from ", "x": 56.99700927734375, "y": 185.65391540527344, "width": 235.4993896484375, "height": 11.029495239257812, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "around the world, working together to determine how ", "x": 56.99700927734375, "y": 198.64988708496094, "width": 231.3944091796875, "height": 11.029495239257812, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "your stories unfold as you face\u00a0a cataclysmic era of ", "x": 56.99700927734375, "y": 211.64585876464844, "width": 216.83380126953125, "height": 11.029495239257812, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "global conflict.", "x": 56.99700927734375, "y": 224.64183044433594, "width": 63.52080535888672, "height": 11.029495239257812, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "The Cosmere RPG", "x": 57.0, "y": 242.93861389160156, "width": 158.54400634765625, "height": 20.897994995117188, "font_size": 18.0, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "The planet Roshar is a small part of a much larger ", "x": 57.0, "y": 265.6820983886719, "width": 213.82220458984375, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "universe known as the cosmere. Dozens of inhabited ", "x": 57.0, "y": 278.6781005859375, "width": 224.082275390625, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "worlds fill the cosmere\u2014worlds of mist, of color, and ", "x": 57.0, "y": 291.6741027832031, "width": 225.13388061523438, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "of powerful divine magic, worlds where adventures ", "x": 57.0, "y": 304.67010498046875, "width": 217.05035400390625, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "abound. The Cosmere RPG uses a rules system ", "x": 57.0, "y": 317.6661071777344, "width": 206.24307250976562, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "designed for not only adventures on Roshar, but ", "x": 56.99999237060547, "y": 330.662109375, "width": 205.0470962524414, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "on\u00a0any\u00a0of these worlds.", "x": 56.99999237060547, "y": 343.6581115722656, "width": 96.53136444091797, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "Adventures on Roshar", "x": 57.0, "y": 361.7606201171875, "width": 169.53598022460938, "height": 18.57598876953125, "font_size": 16.0, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "The first books of the Cosmere RPG focus on the ", "x": 57.0, "y": 382.6820983886719, "width": 212.18533325195312, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "acclaimed Stormlight setting. The battle for the cosmere ", "x": 57.0, "y": 395.6781005859375, "width": 238.75973510742188, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "begins here, as the Knights Radiant and Odium\u2019s forces ", "x": 57.0, "y": 408.6741027832031, "width": 235.744384765625, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "wield powerful Investiture in a conflict spanning all ", "x": 57.0, "y": 421.67010498046875, "width": 218.11807250976562, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "of Roshar.", "x": 57.0, "y": 434.6661071777344, "width": 42.832664489746094, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "Introduction", "x": 202.68409729003906, "y": 43.0, "width": 206.63429260253906, "height": 28.75, "font_size": 23.0, "font_name": "PenumbraSerifStd-Semibol"}, {"text": "The core Stormlight books for the Cosmere RPG ", "x": 329.9985046386719, "y": 95.14798736572266, "width": 211.00796508789062, "height": 11.029502868652344, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "include the following:", "x": 318.00347900390625, "y": 108.14395904541016, "width": 90.4732666015625, "height": 11.029502868652344, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "Stormlight Handbook.", "x": 318.00347900390625, "y": 124.92094421386719, "width": 104.33755493164062, "height": 11.248001098632812, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Bold"}, {"text": " You\u2019re reading this book now! ", "x": 422.3885192871094, "y": 125.13944244384766, "width": 125.58999633789062, "height": 11.029502868652344, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "It contains the foundational rules for playing the game, ", "x": 330.0019836425781, "y": 138.1354217529297, "width": 226.41360473632812, "height": 11.029495239257812, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "such as how to create characters, roll dice, and play ", "x": 330.0019836425781, "y": 151.1313934326172, "width": 211.42245483398438, "height": 11.029495239257812, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "out scenes. You\u2019ll use this handbook alongside either ", "x": 330.0019836425781, "y": 164.1273651123047, "width": 215.23214721679688, "height": 11.029495239257812, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "a published adventure or the ", "x": 330.0019836425781, "y": 177.1233367919922, "width": 119.11102294921875, "height": 11.029495239257812, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "Stormlight World Guide", "x": 449.0655212402344, "y": 177.03782653808594, "width": 91.01956176757812, "height": 11.115005493164062, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Italic"}, {"text": ", ", "x": 540.1231079101562, "y": 177.1233367919922, "width": 5.03497314453125, "height": 11.029495239257812, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "which provides lore and adversary profiles you can ", "x": 330.0019836425781, "y": 190.1193084716797, "width": 208.27810668945312, "height": 11.029495239257812, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "use\u00a0to create your own adventures.", "x": 330.0019836425781, "y": 203.1152801513672, "width": 141.27447509765625, "height": 11.029495239257812, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "Stormlight World Guide. ", "x": 318.00347900390625, "y": 215.8927459716797, "width": 116.40252685546875, "height": 11.248001098632812, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Bold"}, {"text": "This guide explores the ", "x": 434.4544677734375, "y": 216.1112518310547, "width": 99.009033203125, "height": 11.029495239257812, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "history and cultures of Roshar and its place in the ", "x": 330.001953125, "y": 229.1072235107422, "width": 207.64154052734375, "height": 11.029495239257812, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "cosmere. This book contains new canonical lore in ", "x": 330.001953125, "y": 242.1031951904297, "width": 210.12091064453125, "height": 11.029495239257812, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "the form of character biographies, timelines, and ", "x": 330.001953125, "y": 255.0991668701172, "width": 202.69854736328125, "height": 11.029495239257812, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "travelogues. It also provides adversary profiles for ", "x": 330.001953125, "y": 268.0951232910156, "width": 205.674072265625, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "a\u00a0wide range of non-player characters (NPCs).", "x": 330.001953125, "y": 281.09112548828125, "width": 192.403564453125, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "Stonewalkers.", "x": 318.0034484863281, "y": 293.86865234375, "width": 64.47653198242188, "height": 11.24798583984375, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Bold"}, {"text": " The first official Stormlight adventure, ", "x": 382.5274658203125, "y": 294.0871276855469, "width": 161.2816162109375, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "written in close partnership with Brandon Sanderson ", "x": 330.001953125, "y": 307.0831298828125, "width": 219.16412353515625, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "and Dan Wells, takes players from 1st through 8th level ", "x": 330.001953125, "y": 320.0791320800781, "width": 226.6795654296875, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "on an adventure across the continent of Roshar.", "x": 330.001953125, "y": 333.07513427734375, "width": 195.02545166015625, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "Adventures Beyond Roshar", "x": 318.0, "y": 351.22650146484375, "width": 205.93463134765625, "height": 18.57598876953125, "font_size": 16.0, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "Whether you\u2019re ready to adventure throughout the ", "x": 318.0, "y": 372.1479797363281, "width": 213.1990966796875, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "cosmere, or whether you simply want to introduce a ", "x": 318.0, "y": 385.14398193359375, "width": 218.19805908203125, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "character from another world, the ", "x": 318.0, "y": 398.1399841308594, "width": 143.89276123046875, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "Stormlight Handbook", "x": 461.84527587890625, "y": 398.05450439453125, "width": 85.332763671875, "height": 11.114990234375, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Italic"}, {"text": "is just the beginning! You can expand your adventures ", "x": 317.9999694824219, "y": 411.135986328125, "width": 229.03182983398438, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "with other books in the Cosmere RPG series, including ", "x": 317.9999694824219, "y": 424.1319885253906, "width": 236.10458374023438, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "the upcoming ", "x": 317.9999694824219, "y": 437.12799072265625, "width": 60.467559814453125, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "Mistborn Handbook", "x": 378.4200439453125, "y": 437.0425109863281, "width": 79.76290893554688, "height": 11.114990234375, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Italic"}, {"text": ", ", "x": 458.428955078125, "y": 437.12799072265625, "width": 5.36749267578125, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "Mistborn World ", "x": 463.74896240234375, "y": 437.0425109863281, "width": 65.48822021484375, "height": 11.114990234375, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Italic"}, {"text": "Guide", "x": 317.9999694824219, "y": 450.03851318359375, "width": 24.44158935546875, "height": 11.114990234375, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Italic"}, {"text": ", and ", "x": 342.62396240234375, "y": 450.1239929199219, "width": 23.58563232421875, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "Mistborn Legacy", "x": 366.162109375, "y": 450.03851318359375, "width": 66.48193359375, "height": 11.114990234375, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Italic"}, {"text": " adventure.", "x": 432.6820373535156, "y": 450.1239929199219, "width": 46.992645263671875, "height": 11.029510498046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": " Introduction ", "x": 487.4609680175781, "y": 751.8250122070312, "width": 70.18588256835938, "height": 11.02947998046875, "font_size": 9.5, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "1", "x": 570.3950805664062, "y": 751.1599731445312, "width": 5.21002197265625, "height": 11.84002685546875, "font_size": 10.0, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Bold"}, {"text": "The Knights Radiant must stand again.", "x": 194.96629333496094, "y": 524.5379638671875, "width": 222.5568389892578, "height": 13.9320068359375, "font_size": 12.0, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Regular"}, {"text": "The ancient oaths have at last been spoken; the\u00a0spren return. ", "x": 163.63699340820312, "y": 543.4299926757812, "width": 289.1810302734375, "height": 14.03997802734375, "font_size": 12.0, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Italic"}, {"text": "Men\u00a0seek what was lost; I\u00a0fear\u00a0the quest will destroy them.", "x": 170.46499633789062, "y": 559.426025390625, "width": 273.2557067871094, "height": 14.03997802734375, "font_size": 12.0, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Italic"}, {"text": "It is the nature of magic. A broken soul\n", "x": 213.32899475097656, "y": 578.4220581054688, "width": 187.4039764404297, "height": 14.03997802734375, "font_size": 12.0, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Italic"}, {"text": "has cracks into which something else can be fit.\n", "x": 197.1289825439453, "y": 594.4180297851562, "width": 223.9080047607422, "height": 14.03997802734375, "font_size": 12.0, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Italic"}, {"text": "Surgebindings, the\u00a0powers of\u00a0creation themselves;\n", "x": 190.9609832763672, "y": 610.4140014648438, "width": 233.08799743652344, "height": 14.03997802734375, "font_size": 12.0, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Italic"}, {"text": "they can brace a broken soul, but\u00a0they\u00a0can also widen\u00a0its fissures.", "x": 154.91299438476562, "y": 626.4100341796875, "width": 304.9285888671875, "height": 14.03997802734375, "font_size": 12.0, "font_name": "PlantinMTPro-Italic"}, {"text": "MICAH EPSTEIN", "x": 37.59199905395508, "y": 676.5174560546875, "width": 9.152000427246094, "height": 55.20806884765625, "font_size": 8.0, "font_name": "LaskiSans-Regular"}], "pageBounds": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 612.0, "h": 792.0}, "borderedBoxes": []}
